---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactSection from '../../components/ContactSection.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Construction & Interior Design | GlobSol Power Pvt Ltd"
  description="Comprehensive construction management, feasibility studies, interior design fit-outs, and architectural execution."
>
  <section class="page-banner-section pt-130 pb-80" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e73be 0%, #0d4b82 100%);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12 text-center text-white">
          <span class="text-white-50 text-uppercase fw-bold tracking-wider">Services</span>
          <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold text-white mt-2 mb-3">Construction & Interior Design</h1>
          <p class="lead max-w-xl mx-auto opacity-90" style="max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
            Overseeing & Managing Commercial, Residential, and Infrastructure Construction from Concept to Execution
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container py-4">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
          <p class="fs-5 text-secondary mb-5">
            We are construction professionals responsible for overseeing and managing construction projects from inception to completion. Our role involves coordinating all aspects including feasibility, architectural design, procurement, structural building, interior fit-outs, and post-construction commissioning.
          </p>

          <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-4 rounded-3 border bg-light h-100">
                <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-primary mb-2">1. Project Planning & Feasibility</h4>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Assessing project viability, site topography, cost estimation, soil conditions, and municipal regulatory compliance before groundbreaking.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-4 rounded-3 border bg-light h-100">
                <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-primary mb-2">2. Design Coordination</h4>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Collaborating with architects and engineers to ensure specifications align with client goals and budget optimization.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-4 rounded-3 border bg-light h-100">
                <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-primary mb-2">3. Construction Management</h4>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-0">On-site scheduling, safety compliance, structural quality control, and rigorous subcontractor management.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-4 rounded-3 border bg-light h-100">
                <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-primary mb-2">4. Interior Design & Spatial Fit-Outs</h4>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Crafting functional, aesthetic spatial designs, office fit-outs, lighting design, and premium interior finishes.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-3 text-center text-white mb-5" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3763eb 0%, #6f58e8 100%);">
            <h4 class="text-white fw-bold mb-2">Have a Building or Fit-Out Project?</h4>
            <p class="fs-6 mb-3 opacity-90">Partner with GlobSol for end-to-end civil & interior engineering excellence.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-light fw-bold text-primary px-4 py-2 rounded-pill">Get Free Consultation</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ContactSection />
</BaseLayout>
